{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226350","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1222635001:1":{"text":"ルカはまだ意識が戻っていない。ひとまずあたしたちだけで話をしよう。","source_cn":"卢卡还在昏迷中……我们先聊聊吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE9670C9065062965","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ルカはまだ意識が戻っていない。ひとまずあたしたちだけで話をしよう。","female":"ルカはまだ意識が戻っていない。ひとまずあたしたちだけで話をしよう。","variant_male_record_index":"137613","variant_female_record_index":"137614","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222635002:1":{"text":"何があったのか教えてくれるか？","source_cn":"方便和我说说事情的详细经过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF39F90543073BDB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1222635003:0":{"text":"今までの出来事をソニアに報告した……","source_cn":"将这一路的遭遇转述给索尼娅后——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EAD7D496B9D8D25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222635004:1":{"text":"バンティス帝国のアサシンが法具を……","source_cn":"班题斯帝国的杀手抢走了圣器……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B087C6CD538B48A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222635005:1":{"text":"払った代償は大きいが……どうやら、大物がかかったようだな。","source_cn":"这次撒饵抛钩，似乎钓上了一条大鱼，但我们也付出了不小的代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x590F4816CA7B1793","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222635006:1":{"text":"ルカさんは大丈夫ですか？","source_cn":"卢卡他没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD983E000209FB98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222635007:1":{"text":"命に別状はないが、かなりの重傷だ。どれも急所を狙った傷ばかりだからな。","source_cn":"没有生命危险，但那名杀手毫不留情，每一刀都直击要害，卢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69DA3D8B996DD64F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222635008:1":{"text":"そういえば、ボニーも負傷していたが、重傷ではなかった。それが少し気になってな。","source_cn":"说起来，波妮身上也有伤，却伤得并不重，这让我有些想不通。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2C8A0682B0ACFD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222635009:1":{"text":"なぜあのアサシンは、ボニーには手加減をしたのだろう？","source_cn":"那个杀手为什么会对波妮手下留情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CE99716020895ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1222635009":{"text":"なぜあのアサシンは、ボニーには手加減をしたのだろう？","source_cn":"那个杀手为什么会对波妮手下留情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CE99716020895ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222635010:1":{"text":"ボニーさんは、ホジキンさんがバンティス帝国を離れたあとに部下になったのですよね？面識なんてあるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"波妮是霍德希金离开班题斯帝国后才收为下属的吧？那个杀手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A2C5513F61EB2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222635011:1":{"text":"うーん、ボニーさんは彼女の名前を知らなかったみたいだし、親しい関係ではなかったのかも？","source_cn":"嗯……至少波妮完全不知道她的名字呢，应该不太熟吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B46C543919B39ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222635013:1":{"text":"まさか同じ女性だから手加減した、なんてことはないですよね？","source_cn":"总不会因为都是女性，所以手下留情了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46B265EFFF13495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222635014:1":{"text":"その可能性は否定できないわ。","source_cn":"不能排除这个可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94B59A8F96AA1969","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222635015:1":{"text":"面白い考えだな。何はともあれ、これで少しは相手を知ることができた。","source_cn":"有意思。至少，我们对她不是一无所知了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24C21B167683EFE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222635016:1":{"text":"もし本当に女性相手だと手加減するのなら、我々の作戦に取り入れ