x":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1222635020":{"text":"そうだ。この似顔絵はボニーが描いた。","source_cn":"不错，通缉令上的画像，出自波妮之手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE408999885461A5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222635021:0":{"text":"そうだな。上手く特徴を捉えている。芸術の心得があるようだ。","source_cn":"是啊，人物特点突出，她有些艺术天分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF460AFAD04BEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222635022:1":{"text":"とにかく、ボニーの協力でこちらは助かった。","source_cn":"不管怎么说，我也没想到波妮愿意配合，帮大忙了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6716F2C8A842E81B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222635023:1":{"text":"街の住民たちの力を借りて、あのアサシンを捕まえるつもりですね？","source_cn":"你打算借助锈锚港居民的力量，抓住那个杀手吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E45498000A06C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222635024:1":{"text":"ああ。法具を手に入れた今、奴は一刻も早くここから出たいはずだ。","source_cn":"是的。既然那人已经得到了圣器，她一定想尽快离开锈锚港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278817C8A442DFC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema